OL,3,GNEWSABridge stays on risk register as
OL,4,Arepairs continue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA landmark staircase in Leicester has
OL,7,Fremained on Historic England's Heritage
OL,8,FAt Risk Register as restoration work
OL,9,Fcontinues.
OL,11,FThe Grade II* listed staircase, known
OL,12,Flocally as the Rialto Bridge, stands
OL,13,Foutside the Corn Exchange building in
OL,14,FMarket Place and was added to the
OL,15,Fregister in 2024 due to concerns about
OL,16,Fdeteriorating stonework and structural
OL,17,Fissues.
OL,19,FThe register, published on Thursday,
OL,20,Fprovides an annual snapshot of the
OL,21,Fcondition of historic buildings and
OL,22,Fsites in England judged to be at risk.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
